## Trust and audit

This skill runs the wrapped CLI under <`workspace-sandbox` if applicable, or
"the host agent's standard sandboxing" otherwise>. All Vrooli skills are
published with Cosign signatures, SLSA L3 provenance, and SBOMs attached as
OCI referrers. Verify with:

```bash
cosign verify ghcr.io/vrooli/skill-<scenario-slug>:<version> \
  --certificate-identity-regexp 'https://github.com/Vrooli/.*' \
  --certificate-oidc-issuer https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com
```

Report security issues per [skills/SECURITY.md](../SECURITY.md).
